  "html": "<h2>Teaching notes for parents and teachers</h2><h3>How to teach it</h3><p>Sketch the starting collection, the amount found, and the amount given away. Record the total after the first change before continuing.</p><h3>Example to work through together</h3><p>Use the model below as you explain the example. Have your student point to the quantities as you discuss them.</p><div class=\"model two-step-shell-model\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Three stages of Maya’s shell story\" style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><svg role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Seven shells at first, twelve after finding five more, and nine left after giving away three\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 210\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;min-width:520px\"><title>Follow one collection through both changes</title><text x=\"10\" y=\"42\" fill=\"#164f5b\" font-size=\"16\">Start: 7</text><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-0\" cx=\"155\" cy=\"37\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-0\" cx=\"183\" cy=\"37\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-0\" cx=\"211\" cy=\"37\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-0\" cx=\"239\" cy=\"37\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-0\" cx=\"267\" cy=\"37\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-0\" cx=\"295\" cy=\"37\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-0\" cx=\"323\" cy=\"37\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><text x=\"10\" y=\"107\" fill=\"#164f5b\" font-size=\"16\">Find 5: 12</text><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-1\" cx=\"155\" cy=\"102\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-1\" cx=\"183\" cy=\"102\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-1\" cx=\"211\" cy=\"102\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-1\" cx=\"239\" cy=\"102\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-1\" cx=\"267\" cy=\"102\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-1\" cx=\"295\" cy=\"102\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-1\" cx=\"323\" cy=\"102\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-1\" cx=\"351\" cy=\"102\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#b74724\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-1\" cx=\"379\" cy=\"102\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#b74724\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-1\" cx=\"407\" cy=\"102\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#b74724\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-1\" cx=\"435\" cy=\"102\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#b74724\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-1\" cx=\"463\" cy=\"102\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#b74724\"/><text x=\"10\" y=\"172\" fill=\"#164f5b\" font-size=\"16\">Give 3: 9</text><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-2\" cx=\"155\" cy=\"167\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-2\" cx=\"183\" cy=\"167\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-2\" cx=\"211\" cy=\"167\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-2\" cx=\"239\" cy=\"167\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-2\" cx=\"267\" cy=\"167\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-2\" cx=\"295\" cy=\"167\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-2\" cx=\"323\" cy=\"167\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#176e5c\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-2\" cx=\"351\" cy=\"167\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#b74724\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-2\" cx=\"379\" cy=\"167\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#b74724\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-2\" cx=\"407\" cy=\"167\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#b74724\"/><path class=\"given-away\" d=\"M396 156l22 22m0 -22l-22 22\" stroke=\"#c01823\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-2\" cx=\"435\" cy=\"167\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#b74724\"/><path class=\"given-away\" d=\"M424 156l22 22m0 -22l-22 22\" stroke=\"#c01823\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle class=\"shell-counter stage-2\" cx=\"463\" cy=\"167\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#b74724\"/><path class=\"given-away\" d=\"M452 156l22 22m0 -22l-22 22\" stroke=\"#c01823\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></svg><p>Each dot stands for one shell. The five added shells are a different color so you can follow the change. Three crossed-out shells have been given away.</p></div><div class=\"model\"><p class=\"sample-equation\">7 + 5 = 12</p><p>Twelve shells are in the bucket after Maya finds more.</p><p class=\"sample-equation\">12 − 3 = 9</p><p>Nine shells remain after she gives three away.</p></div><h3>Ask your student</h3><blockquote><p>What amount do we have after the first step?</p></blockquote><h3>If your student needs help</h3><p>If the student uses the starting amount again in step two, point to the updated collection.</p>",
